  stepId: firstPestTutorial
  title: Bark Beetle Infestation
  body: Trees have a chance of getting a Bark Beetle infestation. To fight them you
    need to use the pesticide tool. Failing the mini-game damages the tree slightly
    (-8%) and has a chance to spread the beetles to other trees. Ending the round
    with beetles still present damages the tree a lot (-20%) and spreads them further.
